{"title":"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/f/5df6a591474ffd81edd37d8d9f52f6f476caa531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> equals\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/7/07789b060f9e65702fc752f88f4c0820e41871be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 10 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 85 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 110 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 170 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 190$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"461\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of all the measures of the angles must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96bd59024f5cb49b070ca9b0f8906499940c75e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$360^{\\circ}$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" /> since the number of degrees in a full circle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96bd59024f5cb49b070ca9b0f8906499940c75e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$360^{\\circ}$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />. Setting up an equation using this fact, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/c/74c4e490d524213bddb4bb934c29bc2b3239531c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + 60 + 110 = 360$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"183\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/3/d7313f4756ff6eb4bb7879d58b859f6525d3e53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b + 170 = 360$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"142\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/5/075418ac234c6436d92ba88a60657aa37eeee8aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 360 - 170 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 190}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"239\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal\">1999 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Prob